                    "text": "..."
                },
                {
                    "id": "705430102",
                    "speaker": "Dustball",
                    "text": "...Meow."
                },
                {
                    "id": "705430103",
                    "speaker": "Razor",
                    "text": "...It's you. Me, I'm talking."
                },
                {
                    "id": "705430104",
                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                    "text": "Talking... Razor, are you talking to Dustball?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "705430105",
                    "speaker": "Dustball",
                    "text": "Meow, meow-meow."
                },
                {
                    "id": "705430106",
                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                    "text": "It seems like Dustball is trying to say... \"That's right\"?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "705430107",
                    "speaker": "Razor",
                    "text": "A familiar scent, looking for friends."
                },
                {
                    "id": "705430108",
                    "speaker": "Razor",
                    "text": "It is good. Happy."
                },
                {
                    "id": "705430109",
                    "speaker": "Dustball",
                    "text": "Meow, meow."
                },
                {
                    "id": "705430110",
                    "speaker": "Razor",
                    "text": "Friends followed the scent. You came too, happy. On your body, the smell of wind and rain, very familiar... The scent of cats, also familiar."
                },
                {
                    "id": "705430111",
                    "speaker": "Razor",
                    "text": "Paimon, very sweet scent. Smell good."
                },
                {
                    "id": "705430112",
                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                    "text": "Eh!? Sweet... Could that be the flavor of the pancakes Valerina gave us? D—Did Paimon eat that many?",
                    "choices": [
                        {
                            "id": "705430113",
                            "text": "I gave you half of my portion, remember?",
                            "response": [
                                {
                                    "id": "705430115",
                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                    "text": "Really? Paimon didn't even notice... Mmm, it's all the pancake's fault for being so delicious!"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "705430116",
                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                    "text": "Hehe, and Paimon also wants to eat Sweet Madames, Steaks, and Hash Browns... oh, and drink some Apple Cider!"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "705430117",
                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                    "text": "#Okay, that's the menu for the next meal then! C'mon, {NICKNAME}, let's go place our order with Valerina! You come too, Razor!"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "705430118",
                                    "speaker": "Razor",
                                    "text": "Thank... Thank you..."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "705430119",
                                    "speaker": "Razor",
                                    "text": "Dustball has brought me lots of... nuts..."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "705430120",
                                    "speaker": "Razor",
                                    "text": "And, meat boxes... I am very full."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "705430121",
                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                    "text": "Sounds like Valerina ordered delivery, then? Did Dustball deliver the food to you, Razor?"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "705430122",
                                    "speaker": "Dustball",
                                    "text": "Meow-meow. Meow!"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "705430123",
                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                    "text": "Paimon never imagined that the cats would actually end up taking care of the customers here in the Furball Fortress!"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "705430124",
                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                    "text": "Looks like you really are the cat's meow, eh, Razor?"
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "705430114",
                            "text": "No sweat, you can still eat triple what you ate before."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
